[Event "Knight School"]
[Opening "Dutch Defense"]
[Variation "Dutch Defense"]
[ECO "A80"]
[Character "solid"]
[Risk "low"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "none"]
[Themes "e5-outpost,bishop-outside"]
[Kind "rare"]

1. d4 f5 2. Bf4 { Same bishop move as always. It also eyes the b8-h2 diagonal and the e5 square that the f-pawn has weakened. } 2... Nf6
(2... e6 3. Nf3 Nf6 4. e3)
3. e3 3... e6
4. Nf3 4... Be7
5. Bd3 { The bishop points at the f5 pawn and the kingside. } 5... O-O
6. h3 { Gives the bishop on f4 the h2 retreat, so it cannot be trapped by ...g5 or ...Nh5. } 6... b6
7. c4 { Adds a pawn to the centre. Then Nc3 and O-O, with Ne5 as a stable knight outpost. } *
